.env
*.db
*.db-journal
/backend/findo-server

# iOS: Findo.xcodeproj is generated from ios/project.yml via `xcodegen
# generate` (see ios/README.md), so it's never committed. Same for the two
# targets' Info.plist files: XcodeGen writes them from project.yml's
# info.properties on every generate (that's a write, not a merge — a
# hand-edited file at that path gets silently overwritten), so they're
# generated output too, not source.
/ios/*.xcodeproj
/ios/*.xcworkspace
/ios/DerivedData/
/ios/Findo/Info.plist
/ios/FindoFileProvider/Info.plist
**/xcuserdata/
